{# Per-render-block template for AGENTS.md.

   Context variables:
     block:    the eawf.profiles.models.RenderBlock currently being rendered.
     composed: the full ComposedProfile (so future templates can reach for
               provenance / sibling render_blocks if needed).

   The current rendering policy is "the YAML body_template is already markdown,
   emit it verbatim". That gives profile authors complete control over their
   block's surface text without forcing them to think about jinja escaping.

   When a future profile body needs jinja substitution inside body_template,
   replace the line below with `{{ block.body_template | render_jinja(composed) }}`
   or similar — the renderer routes both the block and the composed profile
   into this template's context, so adding a richer expansion is non-breaking.

   The trailing newline matters: replace_region strips one boundary newline at
   each end of the body, so the literal output below round-trips cleanly. #}
{{- block.body_template -}}
